#. type: SH
#: debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide opensuse-tumbleweed
#, no-wrap
msgid "NOTES"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: debian-unstable
msgid ""
"On systems with SELinux, when creating the file, make sure to set the "
"appropriate context, e\\&.g\\&. with \"B<sudo restorecon -v /etc/"
"rc\\&.local>\"\\&."
msgstr ""

